
================
project stucture
================

playwright-pom/
├── config/                  ← Environment settings (dev/staging/prod)
│   ├── env.config.js
│   └── index.js
├── src/                     ← Framework source code
│   ├── pages/               ← Page Object classes (BasePage → LoginPage, etc.)
│   ├── helpers/             ← Utilities (ExcelReader, Screenshot, Wait, API)
│   └── fixtures/            ← Custom fixtures (auto-inject page objects into tests)
├── data/                    ← Test data
│   ├── excel/               ← Excel files
│   └── json/                ← JS data files (env-aware)
├── tests/                   ← All test specs
│   ├── setup/               ← Auth setup (runs first, saves login state)
│   ├── e2e/                 ← UI tests
│   ├── api/                 ← API tests (*.api.spec.js)
│   └── visual/              ← Visual regression (*.visual.spec.js)
├── playwright.config.js     ← Config with all projects/browsers
├── global-setup.js          ← Pre-test health check + directories
├── global-teardown.js       ← Post-test cleanup
└── README.md                ← Full documentation



========
commands
========

Command	Scope
npm test	All tests, all projects
npm run test:web	Web on Chrome
npm run test:web:all	Web on all 4 browsers
npm run test:mobile	iPhone + Android
npm run test:tablet	iPad + Galaxy Tab
npm run test:api	API only (no browser)
npm run test:e2e	End-to-end journeys
npm run test:visual	Screenshot comparisons
npm run test:staging	All tests on staging env
npm run report	Generate + open Allure report
npm run clean	Remove all generated artifacts
To switch environments: npm run test:staging or npm run test:prod.

