===============
unique commands
===============

Here are all the commands:

### Run Individual Test Files

| Command | What it runs |
|---------|-------------|
| `npm run test:login` | Login.spec.js |
| `npm run test:login:excel` | LoginExcel.spec.js (100 data-driven tests) |
| `npm run test:dashboard` | Dashboard.spec.js |
| `npm run test:forgot` | ForgotPassword.spec.js |

### Run by Browser / Device

| Command | What it runs |
|---------|-------------|
| `npm run test:chromium` | All e2e tests on Chrome |
| `npm run test:firefox` | All e2e tests on Firefox |
| `npm run test:webkit` | All e2e tests on Safari |
| `npm run test:mobile` | All e2e tests on mobile (Pixel 7 + iPhone 14) |
| `npm run test:tablet` | All e2e tests on iPad Pro |
| `npm run test:all` | All e2e tests on Chrome + Firefox + Safari |

### Run by Test Type

| Command | What it runs |
|---------|-------------|
| `npm run test:api` | API tests only |
| `npm run test:visual` | Visual regression tests only |

### Utility

| Command | What it does |
|---------|-------------|
| `npm run test` | Run everything (all projects) |
| `npm run test:headed` | Run on Chrome with browser visible |
| `npm run test:debug` | Run with Playwright Inspector (step-by-step) |
| `npm run report` | Run tests + generate + open Allure report |

Simple pattern: `npm run test:<what-you-want>`